:: Widgets Fishing Clothing [widget]
<<widget "fishingClothingCatchText">>
	Your hook snags on something. It doesn't feel like a fish. You reel in <<= $clothingItem.item.word is "n" ? "a pair of" : "a">> waterlogged <<= $clothingItem.colour isnot "" ? "$clothingItem.colour " : "">><<= $clothingItem.item.name>>. <<if $rng gte 90 and $world_corruption_soft >= 70 and $clothingItem.item.type.includes("school")>> You think you remember seeing <<= $clothingItem.item.word is "n" ? "these" : "this">> being worn by someone at your school. Surely <<= $clothingItem.item.word is "n" ? "they're" : "it's">> fine. <<gstress>><<stress 4>><</if>>
<</widget>>
